{
  "slug": "asodev",
  "name": "Asodev",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "ASO.dev Skills is a Claude Code plugin for App Store Optimization and app growth work. It gives product, marketing, and growth teams 27 focused Agent Skills for ASO audits, App Store and Google Play metadata, keyword research, competitor analysis, localization, review analysis, screenshot briefs, In-App Events, featuring nominations, CPP/PPO planning, subscriptions, IAP, pricing, monetization, seasonal campaigns, ASO.dev local AI Companion MCP workflows, and ASO.dev public API guidance.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **27 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (27): `android-aso` (Use when the user wants Google Play Store or Android ASO: Play listing title, short description, full description,…), `app-analytics` (Use when the user wants to interpret ASO.dev Measurements or App Store Connect metrics: downloads, impressions, product page…), `app-context` (Use to read, create, or update ASO.dev per-app project context before metadata, localization, keywords, screenshots, IAP, subscriptions, pricing,…), `app-store-connect-mcp` (Use whenever an ASO.dev skill needs the local localhost AI Companion MCP: reading/filling Apple or Google metadata, nominations,…), `apple-search-ads-intelligence` (Use when the user wants Apple Search Ads or ASO.dev Ads Intelligence analysis: app ads, keyword ads, competitor…), `aso-audit` (Use when the user wants a full ASO audit or health check for an app: metadata, keyword coverage,…), `asodev-public-api` (Use when the user asks about ASO.dev public APIs, Developer API, Partners API, OpenAPI docs, API keys, integration…), `competitor-analysis` (Use when the user wants to analyze App Store or Google Play competitors: competitor metadata, keywords, screenshots, ratings,…), and 19 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install asodev@claude-community` from `asodevapp/skills`.",
